{"id":"a161e3a91eb15602","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-explicit-expander-family.md","title":"显式与强显式邻接接口","display":"df-explicit-expander-family — 显式与强显式邻接接口","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-explicit-expander-family","aliases":["28-df-explicit-expander-family"],"display":"df-explicit-expander-family — 显式与强显式邻接接口","depends_on":["[[28-df-spectral-expander]]","[[28-df-tm]]","[[28-df-machine-resources]]"],"source_book_location":"§21.2.1 Explicit constructions and §21.3.1; printed pp.427,434; PDF pp.453,460","source_printed_pages":"427,434","source_pdf_pages":"453,460","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-explicit-expander-family"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-explicit-expander-family</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-explicit-expander-family — 显式与强显式邻接接口"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"df14955ee1f08cd3\" href=\"?note=df14955ee1f08cd3\" title=\"28-df-spectral-expander\">28-df-spectral-expander</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1965e2b0765554c9\" href=\"?note=1965e2b0765554c9\" title=\"28-df-tm\">28-df-tm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" href=\"?note=b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" title=\"28-df-machine-resources\">28-df-machine-resources</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"§21.2.1 Explicit constructions and §21.3.1; printed pp.427,434; PDF pp.453,460"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"427,434"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"453,460"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(D\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal G=(G_N)_{N\\ge1}\">\\(\\mathcal G=(G_N)_{N\\ge1}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_N\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}\">\\(G_N\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}\\)</span>；图的端口、乘数和邻点接口见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"df14955ee1f08cd3\" href=\"?note=df14955ee1f08cd3\" title=\"28-df-spectral-expander\">28-df-spectral-expander</a> 及其上游。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TM}\">\\(\\mathrm{TM}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M(x)\">\\(M(x)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{time}_M(x)\">\\(\\operatorname{time}_M(x)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1965e2b0765554c9\" href=\"?note=1965e2b0765554c9\" title=\"28-df-tm\">28-df-tm</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" href=\"?note=b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" title=\"28-df-machine-resources\">28-df-machine-resources</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1^N\">\\(1^N\\)</span> 是长度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> 的一元输入。对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(q\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 引入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bin}(q)\">\\(\\operatorname{bin}(q)\\)</span>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(b\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\in\\{0,\\ldots,2^b-1\\}\">\\(q\\in\\{0,\\ldots,2^b-1\\}\\)</span> 引入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bin}_b(q)\">\\(\\operatorname{bin}_b(q)\\)</span>。字串下标从1开始，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle0\\rangle\">\\(\\langle0\\rangle\\)</span> 是单比特零字串，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\">\\(w\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\frown\">\\(\\frown\\)</span> 表示字串串接，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathop{\\frown}_{u=1}^N\\mathop{\\frown}_{v=1}^N\">\\(\\mathop{\\frown}_{u=1}^N\\mathop{\\frown}_{v=1}^N\\)</span> 按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 优先的字典序串接。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_D,e,\\operatorname{code},\\operatorname{in},\\operatorname{Explicit},\\operatorname{StrongExplicit}\">\\(b_D,e,\\operatorname{code},\\operatorname{in},\\operatorname{Explicit},\\operatorname{StrongExplicit}\\)</span> 由下式引入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bin}_b(q)\\coloneqq\\iota w\\in\\{0,1\\}^b\\;\\left(\\sum_{j=1}^b w_j2^{b-j}=q\\right),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{bin}(q)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\langle0\\rangle&amp;q=0,\\\\\n\\operatorname{bin}_{1+\\lfloor\\log_2q\\rfloor}(q)&amp;q\\ge1.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{bin}_b(q)\\coloneqq\\iota w\\in\\{0,1\\}^b\\;\\left(\\sum_{j=1}^b w_j2^{b-j}=q\\right),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{bin}(q)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\langle0\\rangle&amp;q=0,\\\\\n\\operatorname{bin}_{1+\\lfloor\\log_2q\\rfloor}(q)&amp;q\\ge1.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"b_D\\coloneqq\\lceil\\log_2(D+1)\\rceil,\\qquad e(w)\\coloneqq1^{|w|}\\frown0\\frown w.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[b_D\\coloneqq\\lceil\\log_2(D+1)\\rceil,\\qquad e(w)\\coloneqq1^{|w|}\\frown0\\frown w.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{code}(G_N)\\coloneqq\\mathop{\\frown}_{u=1}^N\\mathop{\\frown}_{v=1}^N\\operatorname{bin}_{b_D}(m_{G_N}(u,v)),\\qquad\\operatorname{in}(N,v,i)\\coloneqq e(\\operatorname{bin}(N))\\frown e(\\operatorname{bin}(v))\\frown e(\\operatorname{bin}(i)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{code}(G_N)\\coloneqq\\mathop{\\frown}_{u=1}^N\\mathop{\\frown}_{v=1}^N\\operatorname{bin}_{b_D}(m_{G_N}(u,v)),\\qquad\\operatorname{in}(N,v,i)\\coloneqq e(\\operatorname{bin}(N))\\frown e(\\operatorname{bin}(v))\\frown e(\\operatorname{bin}(i)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Explicit}(\\mathcal G)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\exists a,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall N\\ge1\\;(M(1^N)=\\operatorname{code}(G_N)\\land\\operatorname{time}_M(1^N)\\le c(N+2)^a).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Explicit}(\\mathcal G)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\exists a,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall N\\ge1\\;(M(1^N)=\\operatorname{code}(G_N)\\land\\operatorname{time}_M(1^N)\\le c(N+2)^a).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{StrongExplicit}(\\mathcal G)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\exists a,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall N\\ge1\\;\\forall v\\in[N]\\;\\forall i\\in[D]\\;\n\\left(M(\\operatorname{in}(N,v,i))=\\operatorname{bin}(\\operatorname{nbr}_{G_N}(v,i))\\land\\operatorname{time}_M(\\operatorname{in}(N,v,i))\\le c(1+\\lceil\\log_2(N+1)\\rceil)^a\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{StrongExplicit}(\\mathcal G)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\exists a,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall N\\ge1\\;\\forall v\\in[N]\\;\\forall i\\in[D]\\;\n\\left(M(\\operatorname{in}(N,v,i))=\\operatorname{bin}(\\operatorname{nbr}_{G_N}(v,i))\\land\\operatorname{time}_M(\\operatorname{in}(N,v,i))\\le c(1+\\lceil\\log_2(N+1)\\rceil)^a\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这里把书中输出邻接矩阵的显式性落实为输出整数乘数矩阵；固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 时它与归一化矩阵可相互有效换算。输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1^N\">\\(1^N\\)</span> 的多项式时间允许读取整个图，而强显式算法只读取规模、顶点和端口的二进制编码，时间为规模的多对数。它输出邻点，不额外要求返回逆端口；需要有效旋转映射的构造应另行声明该更强接口。</p>\n<p>所有矩阵条目在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[0,D]\">\\([0,D]\\)</span>，故固定宽度编码存在唯一；自分隔输入可唯一解析。强显式算法枚举 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ND\">\\(ND\\)</span> 个端口并累计邻接乘数，可以在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> 的多项式时间输出本编码，因此强显式蕴含显式。原书“显式扩展图族”是这些计算性条件与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ExpFamily}(\\mathcal G)\">\\(\\operatorname{ExpFamily}(\\mathcal G)\\)</span> 的合取；计算性条件单独不保证扩张。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-spectral-expander","status":"resolved","id":"df14955ee1f08cd3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-spectral-expander]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-tm","status":"resolved","id":"1965e2b0765554c9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-tm]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-machine-resources","status":"resolved","id":"b5d4fc2d291ce98b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-machine-resources]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-spectral-expander","status":"resolved","id":"df14955ee1f08cd3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$D\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$\\mathcal G=(G_N)_{N\\ge1}$ 且 $G_N\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}$；图的端口、乘数和邻点接口见 [[28-df-spectral-expander]] 及其上游。$\\mathrm{TM}$、$M(x)$、$\\operatorname{time}_M(x)$ 见 [[28-df-tm]]、[[28-df-machine-resources]]。$1^N$ 是长度 $N$ 的一元输入。对 $q\\in\\mathbb N$ 引入 $\\operatorname{bin}(q)$；对 $b\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$、$q\\in\\{0,\\ldots,2^b-1\\}$ 引入 $\\operatorname{bin}_b(q)$。字串下标从1开始，$\\langle0\\rangle$ 是单比特零字串，$w\\in\\{0,1\\}^*$。$\\frown$ 表示字串串接，$\\mathop{\\frown}_{u=1}^N\\mathop{\\frown}_{v=1}^N$ 按 $u$ 优先的字典序串接。$b_D,e,\\operatorname{code},\\operatorname{in},\\operatorname{Explicit},\\operatorname{StrongExplicit}$ 由下式引入。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-tm","status":"resolved","id":"1965e2b0765554c9","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$D\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$\\mathcal G=(G_N)_{N\\ge1}$ 且 $G_N\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}$；图的端口、乘数和邻点接口见 [[28-df-spectral-expander]] 及其上游。$\\mathrm{TM}$、$M(x)$、$\\operatorname{time}_M(x)$ 见 [[28-df-tm]]、[[28-df-machine-resources]]。$1^N$ 是长度 $N$ 的一元输入。对 $q\\in\\mathbb N$ 引入 $\\operatorname{bin}(q)$；对 $b\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$、$q\\in\\{0,\\ldots,2^b-1\\}$ 引入 $\\operatorname{bin}_b(q)$。字串下标从1开始，$\\langle0\\rangle$ 是单比特零字串，$w\\in\\{0,1\\}^*$。$\\frown$ 表示字串串接，$\\mathop{\\frown}_{u=1}^N\\mathop{\\frown}_{v=1}^N$ 按 $u$ 优先的字典序串接。$b_D,e,\\operatorname{code},\\operatorname{in},\\operatorname{Explicit},\\operatorname{StrongExplicit}$ 由下式引入。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-machine-resources","status":"resolved","id":"b5d4fc2d291ce98b","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$D\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$\\mathcal G=(G_N)_{N\\ge1}$ 且 $G_N\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}$；图的端口、乘数和邻点接口见 [[28-df-spectral-expander]] 及其上游。$\\mathrm{TM}$、$M(x)$、$\\operatorname{time}_M(x)$ 见 [[28-df-tm]]、[[28-df-machine-resources]]。$1^N$ 是长度 $N$ 的一元输入。对 $q\\in\\mathbb N$ 引入 $\\operatorname{bin}(q)$；对 $b\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$、$q\\in\\{0,\\ldots,2^b-1\\}$ 引入 $\\operatorname{bin}_b(q)$。字串下标从1开始，$\\langle0\\rangle$ 是单比特零字串，$w\\in\\{0,1\\}^*$。$\\frown$ 表示字串串接，$\\mathop{\\frown}_{u=1}^N\\mathop{\\frown}_{v=1}^N$ 按 $u$ 优先的字典序串接。$b_D,e,\\operatorname{code},\\operatorname{in},\\operatorn